@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Hiragino Sans"
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
hide empty description
state "構成中" as Configuring
state "アクティブ" as Active
[*] --> Configuring : gf_frame_create
Configuring : Runtime を所有
Configuring : load / add_capability
Configuring : validate / initialize_restart
Configuring --> Configuring : アクティブ化の失敗\n(状態は保持)
Configuring --> Active : gf_frame_activate\n(Runtime を 1 回だけ移動)
Active : ScanDriver を所有
Active : gf_frame_scan
Active : load / add / activate は拒否
Active --> Active : スキャンの失敗\n(直前の結果と VM 状態を保持)
Configuring --> [*] : gf_frame_destroy
Active --> [*] : gf_frame_destroy
@enduml
